      coda: ["At the end-of-term feast, every pudding sang a song, and every song was about {PLAYER}. The custard sang the harmony.", "THE HEADMISTRESS OF MAGIC: Ten thousand gold stars for {PLAYER}! I'm not sure that's allowed. I'm the headmistress. It's allowed."],
