      titles: ['The {G} of the Fairy Queen', 'Midsummer and the {G}', 'The {G} Under the Hill', 'The Fair Folk of {S}'],
      coda: ["{PLAYER} stepped out of the fairy ring at dawn. It had only been one night. Probably. The bees, oddly, were saying hello.", "THE FAIRY HERALD: Fare thee well, mortal {PLAYER}. The fair folk will remember you. That is either very good or very complicated."],
