        "There's a little bell over the door. Every time it rings, everybody looks up. Just in case.",
        "My husband proposed to me in this tea shop. He hid the ring in a scone. I nearly ate it.",
        "Rainy days are the best in here. The windows steam up. It's like being inside a cloud with cake.",
