      coda: ["The sign on the door turned to CLOSED, and the last of the evening light came through the window onto an empty, crumby, happy table.", "THE TEA SHOP OWNER: Same time tomorrow, {PLAYER}? I'll keep your table. And a scone. The good kind."],
