      coda: ["The little curtain closed, and from behind it, a sock popped up to wave goodbye. The whole of {HOME} waved back.", "THE PUPPETEER: (as Mr. Sock) Thank you, {PLAYER}! You've been a wonderful audience! (own voice) He means it. He's a very sincere sock."],
