      coda: ["All over {HOME}, people switched off their radios and sat for a moment in the quiet, still seeing the story in their heads.", "THE SOUND-EFFECTS MAN: (clop clop clop) That's you, {PLAYER}, riding off into the sunset. Coconuts never lie."],
